## Advance, revisit, pause, and escalate

Advance only after teach commits two qualifying independent full passes under a listed route. Keep acquisition and each later delayed observation separate. A source conflict blocks the affected claim and returns to ingest with the exact note heading. Missing criteria, a new method, unsupported alternative or exhausted fresh bank returns to plan with 2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Comparative_Economics, O010, revision1/O010-C1, P002/V002/ingestion2 and item ID. Equivalent valid methods meeting the frozen criterion may receive credit after verification; no criterion is changed to fit an answer. Closing a session preserves the actual stopping point without claiming completion.

## Content provenance and generation boundaries

Explanations, figures and qualifications above reuse complete checked-note sections with exact origin/fingerprint; heading depth alone is adapted. Main exercises and worked arithmetic are plan-created hypothetical instantiations of those displayed identities. No additional academic claims or external course scope are introduced. Preserve the note conventions and explicit qualifications; checked references reused from notes are not an independent raw-source audit by plan. New numerical practice can use the same method only after its complete solution and unchanged components are checked before display; it cannot replace this lesson’s named evidence forms. Prerequisites route to the complete prepared lessons above.

## Answer-free recall handoff

Topic: Construct and qualify a canonical synthetic control. Begin a closed-note review with teach for O010; request an unused prepared delayed item before recap. Exact lesson: [[03_Agents/2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Comparative_Economics/lessons/O010.md#Immediate and delayed checks]]. Teach supplies actual committed evidence and timestamps; recall alone dates reviews. No learner outcome or due date is created by this curriculum.
